# D3 (artifact-hosting decoupling): release artifacts live on Blossom, never
# in the repo. Ignore every binary form so a stray publish can't re-commit one;
# the manifests (charter-apk.json etc.) name the Blossom URL instead.
public/*.apk
public/*.apk.txt
public/*.deb
